  "question": "Where can I find a restaurant within 160 kilometers toward the west of Lincoln Park Zoo, Manitowoc, WI?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.649084 44.11068)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.649084 44.11068)',4326)::geography, 160000)\nAND amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 247.5 AND 292.5;\n",
